<title>FRANCE: France Telecom stays mum on Havas stake.</title>
<headline>France Telecom stays mum on Havas stake.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>France Telecom chairman Michel Bon declined to say whether the company would remain in media group Havas, in which future rival Cie Generale des Eaux has become the main shareholder.</p>
<p>But he did make clear that the operator's historic link with Havas centred on the ODA yellow pages publisher. France Telecom and Havas in February agreed that Havas would sell its stake in ODA to France Telecom after January 1, 2000.</p>
<p>France Telecom has a stake of some three percent in Havas.</p>
</text>
